      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here are the full details of your **Q3 2026 Sales Report**:\n\n---\n\n# Meridian Analytics \u2014 Q3 2026 Business Report\n\n**Period:** July 1 \u2013 September 7, 2026\n**Prepared by:** Rachel Kim, VP of Sales | Claire Fontaine, CFO\n**Distribution:** Executive Team\n\n---\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nQ3 2026 marks another strong quarter for Meridian Analytics. Across the 15-person team, **14 deals were closed out of 22 opportunities**, generating **$1,040,000** in new contract value. The sales pipeline remains healthy with several high-value deals still in pending status. Customer support ticket volume held steady, with all critical issues resolved same-day.\n\n---\n\n## Sales Performance\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Total Closed Revenue** | $1,040,000 |\n| **Leading Region** | South ($468,000 in won deals) |\n| **Win Rate** | 63.6% (target: 55%) |\n| **Deals Won / Total** | 14 / 22 |\n| **Pending Deals** | ~$240,000 across 3 deals |\n\nThe three-person field sales team \u2014 **James Okafor**, **Sofia Delgado**, and **Marcus Webb** \u2014 collectively worked 22 active opportunities. Product mix shifted toward **Meridian Insights Pro** (majority of closed revenue), while **Meridian DataBridge** continues as a strong land-and-expand vehicle.\n\n---\n\n## Deal-Level Detail (22 Deals)\n\n| Deal | Rep | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date | Status |\n|------|-----|--------|---------|--------|------------|--------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | North | Insights Pro | $87,500 | Jul 5 | \u2705 Won |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | South | Insights Pro | $62,000 | Jul 8 | \u2705 Won |\n| D003 | James Okafor | East | DataBridge | $43,000 | Jul 12 | \u2705 Won |\n| D004 | Marcus Webb | West | Insights Lite | $9,500 | Jul 15 | \u274c Lost |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | North | DataBridge | $55,000 | Jul 19 | \u2705 Won |\n| D006 | James Okafor | South | Insights Pro | $120,000 | Jul 22 | \u2705 Won |\n| D007 | Marcus Webb | East | Insights Lite | $7,800 | Jul 28 | \u23f3 Pending |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | West | DataBridge | $38,000 | Aug 2 | \u2705 Won |\n| D009 | James Okafor | North | Insights Pro | $95,000 | Aug 5 | \u2705 Won |\n| D010 | Sofia Delgado | East | Insights Pro | $74,000 | Aug 9 | \u2705 Won |\n| D011 | Marcus Webb | South | Insights Lite | $12,000 | Aug 11 | \u274c Lost |\n| D012 | James Okafor | West | DataBridge | $66,000 | Aug 14 | \u2705 Won |\n| D013 | Sofia Delgado | North | Insights Pro | $105,000 | Aug 18 | \u23f3 Pending |\n| D014 | Marcus Webb | East | Insights Lite | $8,500 | Aug 21 | \u2705 Won |\n| D015 | James Okafor | South | Insights Pro | $88,000 | Aug 25 | \u2705 Won |\n| D016 | Sofia Delgado | West | DataBridge | $47,000 | Aug 28 | \u274c Lost |\n| D017 | James Okafor | North | DataBridge | $72,000 | Sep 2 | \u2705 Won |\n| D018 | Marcus Webb | East | Insights Lite | $5,500 | Sep 4 | \u23f3 Pending |\n| D019 | Sofia Delgado | South | Insights Pro | $198,000 | Sep 5 | \u2705 Won |\n| D020 | James Okafor | West | Insights Pro | $115,000 | Sep 6 | \u23f3 Pending |\n| D021 | Sofia Delgado | North | DataBridge | $33,000 | Sep 7 | \u2705 Won |\n| D022 | Marcus Webb | South | Insights Lite | $11,000 | Sep 7 | \u23f3 Pending |\n\n---\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n- \ud83c\udfc6 **Top deal:** Sofia Delgado \u2014 $198,000 Insights Pro contract (D019, Sep 5)\n- \ud83d\udc65 **Headcount:** 15 employees across Sales (4), Engineering (5), Product (3), HR (1), Finance (2)\n- \u2705 **Support SLA:** All critical-priority tickets resolved within 24 hours\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **License utilization:** SKU-001 (Insights Pro) at 94% capacity \u2014 procurement review scheduled for October\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Close the 4 pending deals (D007, D013, D020, D022) before Q3 end\n2. Begin Q4 pipeline review \u2014 target $1.2M in new ARR\n3. Resolve open support tickets (TKT-013, TKT-016, TKT-019) ahead of quarterly customer success calls\n4. Conduct license capacity review for SKU-001 and SKU-003 in early October\n5. HR to initiate two new engineering hire approvals with Kenji Obi for Q4 roadmap\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to drill into any specific area \u2014 such as rep-level performance, regional breakdowns, product mix analysis, or the pending deals?",
